First_time_India_traveller"}', '{"History_buff": "Rich Rajput and Mughal architecture and museums.", "Families": "Fort visits, elephant/jeep rides at Amer, easy logistics."}'::jsonb, 'Forts and palaces involve stair climbing; hot afternoons in summer.', 2.0, 3.0, 4, 'Day 1: City Palace, Jantar Mantar, Hawa Mahal; Day 2: Amer Fort and Jaigarh; Day 3: Nahargarh Fort sunset and local markets.', 'Budget hotels | Havelis | Heritage hotels | Luxury hotels', 'Strong Rajasthani cuisine, sweets, and street food; many vegetarian options.', 8.0, 'Busy markets; watch for pickpockets in crowds and negotiate auto fares.', 'Good 4G and wired broadband in city.', 'Jio | Airtel | Vi', 'Very good coverage across the city.', 'Hindi | Rajasthani | English widely understood', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Mix of Rajput royal heritage and vibrant local traditions.', 'Jaipur Literature Festival, Teej, Holi, Diwali.', 'Dress modestly at religious places; bargaining common in bazaars.', 'Handicrafts | Block-printed textiles | Jewellery | Blue pottery', 'Dal Baati Churma | Ghewar | Kachori | Laal Maas (for non-vegetarians)', '{"accommodation_range": [700, 1400], "food_range": [250, 500], "activities_range": [200, 400], "local_transport_range": [150, 300], "total_daily_range": [1300, 2600]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1500, 3500], "food_range": [400, 800], "activities_range": [300, 700], "local_transport_range": [300, 600], "total_daily_range": [2500, 5600]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [6000, 18000], "food_range": [1000, 2500], "activities_range": [700, 2000], "local_transport_range": [600, 1200], "total_daily_range": [8300, 23700]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Jaipur in Rajasthan.', 'Highly recommended for first-time visitors to India and heritage lovers.', 'Tourism infrastructure and palace restoration projects have improved visitor facilities.', 'Support heritage conservation by using authorised guides and tickets.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
