.', '{"Pilgrims","Spiritual_seekers","Photographers","Culture_lovers"}', '{"Pilgrims": "Major Hindu tirtha with many temples and ghats.", "Photographers": "Vivid scenes of daily ritual life along the river."}'::jsonb, 'Crowds around main ghats and temple; strong sights and smells at cremation ghats; respect photography restrictions.', 2.0, 3.0, 4, 'Day 1: Evening Ganga Aarti and ghats; Day 2: Sunrise boat ride, Kashi Vishwanath and old city; Day 3: Sarnath excursion and quieter ghats.', 'Budget lodges | Ghatside guesthouses | Mid-range hotels | Luxury hotels', 'Famous for vegetarian food, sweets, chaat and lassi; mostly budget-friendly.', 7.0, 'Busy and crowded; keep valuables secure; be cautious with touts offering boat rides or ‘special darshan’.', 'Good in most central areas.', 'Jio | Airtel | Vi', 'Good coverage in central city and by major roads.', 'Hindi | Bhojpuri | English (in tourist areas)', FALSE, 'Not required', 'One of the oldest continuously inhabited cities, with deep ritual and philosophical traditions.', 'Dev Deepawali, important Hindu festivals, and frequent local melas.', 'Dress modestly; remove shoes in temples; do not photograph cremations without explicit permission.', 'Banarasi silk sarees | Brassware | Rudraksha and religious items', 'Kachori-sabzi | Banarasi paan | Lassi | Street chaat', '{"accommodation_range": [600, 1200], "food_range": [250, 500], "activities_range": [200, 400], "local_transport_range": [150, 300], "total_daily_range": [1200, 2400]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1500, 3000], "food_range": [400, 800], "activities_range": [300, 700], "local_transport_range": [250, 500], "total_daily_range": [2450, 5000]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [5000, 15000], "food_range": [800, 2000], "activities_range": [700, 2000], "local_transport_range": [400, 800], "total_daily_range": [6900, 23800]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Varanasi (Kashi) in Uttar Pradesh.', 'Intense but unforgettable experience; spiritual and photogenic but can feel overwhelming.', 'Major riverfront and infrastructure upgrades as part of Kashi development projects.', 'River-cleaning and ghat conservation underway; support operators who follow waste and pollution norms.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
