ic days for maintenance or official events; check Taj Mahal timings and ticket rules.', 1.0, 2.0, 3, 'Day 1: Taj Mahal at sunrise, Agra Fort, Mehtab Bagh in evening; Day 2: Itmad-ud-Daulah and local markets.', 'Budget hotels | Mid-range hotels | Luxury hotels with Taj views', 'North Indian cuisine with many budget and mid-range restaurants.', 8.0, 'Tourist-heavy; common touts; use official guides where needed.', 'Good 4G coverage.', 'Jio | Airtel | Vi', 'Good in city and tourist areas.', 'Hindi | English widely used in tourism sector', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Mughal heritage city with strong tourism orientation.', 'Taj Mahotsav cultural festival and standard Indian festivals.', 'Security checks at monuments; certain items not allowed inside Taj premises.', 'Marble handicrafts | Inlay work | Leather goods', 'Petha sweets | Mughlai dishes', '{"accommodation_range": [700, 1400], "food_range": [250, 500], "activities_range": [300, 600], "local_transport_range": [150, 300], "total_daily_range": [1400, 2800]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1500, 3500], "food_range": [400, 800], "activities_range": [600, 1000], "local_transport_range": [300, 600], "total_daily_range": [2800, 5900]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [5000, 16000], "food_range": [800, 2000], "activities_range": [800, 2000], "local_transport_range": [400, 800], "total_daily_range": [7000, 24800]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Agra in Uttar Pradesh.', 'Must-see for Taj Mahal; most visitors stay 1–2 nights.', 'Improved visitor facilities and e-ticketing systems.', 'Air-quality measures and traffic restrictions near Taj to protect the monument.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
