January', 'Late monsoon weeks and shoulder months (variable)', '{"winter": "-2-12\u00b0C (colder at higher points)", "summer": "12-28\u00b0C", "monsoon": "15-22\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'Moderate to heavy monsoon with occasional road blockages.', '{"Adventure_seekers","Families","Honeymooners","Road_trip_planners"}', '{"Adventure_seekers": "Solang, Rohtang, paragliding, rafting, treks.", "Honeymooners": "Scenic valleys, cafes, variety of stays."}'::jsonb, 'Rohtang permits may be required; weather and snow can close passes; traffic jams in peak holiday periods.', 3.0, 4.0, 6, 'Day 1: Hadimba, Old Manali; Day 2: Solang Valley; Day 3: Rohtang/Atal Tunnel region (seasonal); extra days for Naggar or Kasol side-trips.', 'Budget hotels | Guesthouses | Cottages | Resorts', 'Many restaurants and cafes offering North Indian, Tibetan, and continental dishes.', 8.0, 'Adventure activities must be booked with reputable operators; road safety important in winter and monsoon.', 'Good in town; moderate in some surrounding villages.', 'Jio | Airtel | Vi', 'Several ATMs in Manali town.', 'Hindi | Pahari | English (tourism)', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Himachali hill culture with strong tourism influence.', 'Winter Carnival, Dussehra celebrations in Kullu valley.', 'Temple etiquette at Hadimba and local shrines.', 'Woollens | Handicrafts | Dry fruits', 'Siddu | Trout fish (where available) | Local thali', '{"accommodation_range": [800, 1500], "food_range": [250, 500], "activities_range": [300, 700], "local_transport_range": [250, 500], "total_daily_range": [1600, 3200]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1500, 3500], "food_range": [400, 800], "activities_range": [700, 1400], "local_transport_range": [300, 700], "total_daily_range": [2900, 6400]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [5000, 15000], "food_range": [800, 2000], "activities_range": [1200, 2500], "local_transport_range": [500, 1000], "total_daily_range": [7500, 20500]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Manali in Himachal Pradesh.', 'Very popular, some