ie"}', '{"Families": "Open meadow space and relaxed pace.", "Road_trippers_from_Dalhousie": "Good half-day or full-day excursion."}'::jsonb, 'Limited stay options directly at meadow; typically combined with Dalhousie stays.', 1.0, 1.0, 2, 'Day trip from Dalhousie: drive, spend several hours at the meadow, forest walk and return.', 'Basic hotels | Guesthouses | More options in Dalhousie', 'Small eateries and stalls; more variety in Dalhousie.', 8.0, 'Generally safe; supervise children near slopes and animals.', 'Limited; better in Dalhousie town.', 'Jio | Airtel | Vi (signal can fluctuate)', 'Better to use ATMs in Dalhousie or Chamba.', 'Hindi | Pahari', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Himachali village environment around a famous meadow.', 'Local fairs and seasonal gatherings.', 'Respect natural environment; avoid littering the meadow.', 'Basic souvenirs; better shopping options back in Dalhousie', 'Simple North Indian and local hill dishes from dhabas', '{"accommodation_range": [700, 1300], "food_range": [250, 500], "activities_range": [200, 400], "local_transport_range": [200, 400], "total_daily_range": [1350, 2600]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1300, 2500], "food_range": [400, 800], "activities_range": [400, 800], "local_transport_range": [300, 600], "total_daily_range": [2400, 4700]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [3000, 7000], "food_range": [600, 1500], "activities_range": [600, 1500], "local_transport_range": [400, 800], "total_daily_range": [4600, 10800]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Khajjiar in Himachal Pradesh.', 'Very scenic small meadow destination best visited from nearby hill towns.', 'Better tourism management and basic facilities around the meadow.', 'Crowding and litter are risks; follow leave-no-trace principles.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
