0--5\u00b0C", "summer": "5-20\u00b0C", "monsoon": "5-18\u00b0C (rain shadow, mostly dry)"}'::jsonb, 'Very low rainfall; region is largely in a rain shadow.', '{"Adventure_seekers","Photographers","Long_road_trip_travellers","Spiritual_explorers"}', '{"Adventure_seekers": "Remote, rough roads and high altitudes.", "Photographers": "Unique stark landscapes and monasteries."}'::jsonb, 'Altitude sickness risk; limited medical facilities; fuel, cash and connectivity can be sparse.', 5.0, 7.0, 12, 'Shimla–Kinnaur–Spiti circuit or Manali–Kaza–Spiti–Kinnaur, spread over 7–10 days with acclimatisation stops.', 'Homestays | Guesthouses | Basic hotels | Seasonal camps', 'Simple local and Indian food; limited menus; expect basic but filling meals.', 7.0, 'Environmental challenges more than crime; travel with contingency time and supplies.', 'Very limited and often slow; some 4G spots around Kaza and larger villages.', 'BSNL primary; Jio in some pockets', 'One or few ATMs in Kaza; unreliable; carry sufficient cash.', 'Hindi | Tibeto-Himachali dialects | Basic English with tourism providers', TRUE, 'Some routes may require permits (especially for foreigners); check latest local rules.', 'Tibetan Buddhist highland culture with monasteries and unique village customs.', 'Local monastery festivals and seasonal celebrations.', 'Respect monastery rules; ask before photographing people or rituals.', 'Small handicrafts | Prayer items | Local woollens', 'Momos | Thukpa | Butter tea | Local breads and lentil dishes', '{"accommodation_range": [600, 1200], "food_range": [300, 600], "activities_range": [300, 600], "local_transport_range": [400, 700], "total_daily_range": [1600, 3100]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1200, 2500], "food_range": [600, 1000], "activities_range": [600, 1200], "local_transport_range": [700, 1200], "total_daily_range": [3100, 5900]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [3000, 7000], "food_range": [800, 1500], "activities_range": [1000, 2000], "local_transport_range": [1000, 1500], "total_daily_range": [5800, 12000]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Spiti Valley in Himachal Pradesh.', 'Challenging but unforgettable; considered a ‘once in a lifetime’ road journey by many.', 'Road improvements and more structured homestay options in some villages.', 'Waste disposal is a major concern; pack out trash, conserve water, and support community-run stays.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
