summer": "15-25\u00b0C", "monsoon": "12-20\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'Receives both southwest and northeast monsoon influence; misty weather common.', '{"Families","Couples","First_time_hill_station_visitors_in_South"}', '{"Families": "Boating, gardens, viewpoints, easy logistics.", "Couples": "Cool climate and scenic tea hills."}'::jsonb, 'Town centre can be crowded; traffic on narrow roads; toy train seats need advance booking in peak season.', 2.0, 3.0, 4, 'Day 1: Lake and gardens; Day 2: Doddabetta and tea estates; Day 3: Toy train towards Coonoor and back.', 'Hotels | Resorts | Homestays | Heritage bungalows', 'Mixed South Indian and multi-cuisine options; bakeries and small cafes.', 8.0, 'Generally safe; drive carefully on steep, hairpin roads.', 'Good in town and many resorts.', 'Jio | Airtel | Vi', 'Plentiful in Ooty town.', 'Tamil | Kannada (some) | Hindi (some) | English widely in tourism)', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Nilgiri hills with mix of local communities and long-standing tourism.', 'Flower Show, Tea and Tourism Festival.', 'Standard hill-station etiquette; respect estate property boundaries.', 'Homemade chocolates | Tea | Essential oils | Woollens', 'South Indian tiffin items | Local bakery products | Fresh hill vegetables-based dishes', '{"accommodation_range": [800, 1500], "food_range": [250, 500], "activities_range": [200, 400], "local_transport_range": [200, 400], "total_daily_range": [1450, 2800]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1500, 3500], "food_range": [400, 800], "activities_range": [400, 800], "local_transport_range": [300, 600], "total_daily_range": [2600, 5700]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [5000, 15000], "food_range": [800, 2000], "activities_range": [800, 1600], "local_transport_range": [400, 800], "total_daily_range": [7000, 19400]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Ooty (Udhagamandalam) in Tamil Nadu.', 'Long-time favourite hill station with a somewhat busy town but beautiful surroundings.', 'More resorts and homestays in outskirts, better tourist infrastructure at key points.', 'Waste from tourism and traffic is an issue; prefer walking or shared transport where possible.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
