": "14-22\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'Heavy rainfall in monsoon with lush greenery afterwards.', '{"Couples","Families","Nature_lovers","Tea_enthusiasts"}', '{"Couples": "Romantic misty views and resort stays.", "Tea_enthusiasts": "Tours and tastings at estates and museums."}'::jsonb, 'Eravikulam NP closes for several weeks yearly for Nilgiri tahr breeding; check dates.', 2.0, 3.0, 4, 'Day 1: Tea museum and nearby plantations; Day 2: Eravikulam NP and viewpoints; Day 3: Mattupetty, Echo Point and Top Station side trip.', 'Resorts | Hotels | Homestays | Estate bungalows', 'Kerala and multi-cuisine restaurants; many resorts offer buffet meals.', 8.0, 'Generally safe; driving on misty, narrow roads requires care.', 'Good in town and most mid/high-end resorts.', 'Jio | Airtel | Vi (varies by valley)', 'ATMs in Munnar town; fewer in outer areas.', 'Malayalam | Tamil (some) | Hindi (some) | English (tourism)', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Tea plantation economy with mixed local communities.', 'Onam activities, local temple and church festivals.', 'Respect estate rules and avoid disturbing tea plucking work.', 'Tea | Spices | Homemade chocolates | Essential oils', 'Appam with stew | Kerala meals on banana leaf | Local fish curries (downhill areas)', '{"accommodation_range": [800, 1500], "food_range": [250, 500], "activities_range": [200, 400], "local_transport_range": [250, 500], "total_daily_range": [1500, 2900]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1500, 3500], "food_range": [400, 800], "activities_range": [400, 900], "local_transport_range": [300, 600], "total_daily_range": [2600, 5800]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [5000, 15000], "food_range": [800, 2000], "activities_range": [800, 1600], "local_transport_range": [400, 800], "total_daily_range": [7000, 19400]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Munnar in Kerala.', 'Highly rated for scenic tea hills and cool weather; can be busy on long weekends.', 'New resorts and improved roads around main tourist belt.', 'Over-tourism and waste near popular viewpoints; support eco-conscious accommodations and avoid littering.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
