–September)', '{"winter": "23-30\u00b0C", "summer": "26-34\u00b0C", "monsoon": "24-30\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'Heavy coastal monsoon from June to September; sea can be rough.[web:209]', '{"Pilgrims","Families","Photography_enthusiasts","Coastal_sightseers"}', '{"Pilgrims": "Kumari Amman Temple and other shrines plus rock memorial.[web:212]", "Photography_enthusiasts": "Sunrise between the memorial and statue and colourful sunsets over the sea.[web:205][web:209]"}'::jsonb, 'Ferry to Vivekananda Rock is weather-dependent; queues can be long in peak season; strong sun and humidity.', 1.0, 2.0, 3, 'Day 1: Sunrise Point, Kumari Amman Temple, ferry to Vivekananda Rock and Thiruvalluvar Statue, Sunset View Point; Day 2: Coastal walks and nearby temples/markets.[web:205][web:207][web:209][web:212]', 'Budget hotels | Mid-range hotels | Simple lodges', 'South Indian vegetarian restaurants and a few multi-cuisine options around the beach and town.', 8.0, 'Generally safe; watch for slippery rocks near sea and follow safety barricades.', 'Good 4G in town and around main attractions.', 'Jio | Airtel | Vi', 'Multiple ATMs in town centre.', 'Tamil | Malayalam (some) | Hindi (some) | English (tourist areas)', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Strong Hindu pilgrimage centre with coastal fishing community.', 'Important Hindu festivals, special temple events and New Year sunrise gatherings.', 'Dress modestly for temple visits; follow temple rules; remove footwear at shrines.', 'Shell crafts and souvenirs | Religious items | Local spices', 'South Indian tiffin items | Fresh coconut-based dishes | Local fish preparations (outside temple zones)', '{"accommodation_range": [700, 1300], "food_range": [250, 500], "activities_range": [200, 400], "local_transport_range": [150, 300], "total_daily_range": [1300, 2500]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1300, 2500], "food_range": [400, 800], "activities_range": [300, 700], "local_transport_range": [250, 500], "total_daily_range": [2250, 4500]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [3000, 8000], "food_range": [700, 1500], "activities_range": [500, 1200], "local_transport_range": [400, 800], "total_daily_range": [4600, 11500]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Kanyakumari in Tamil Nadu.', 'Highly appreciated for sunrise/sunset views and rock memorial; town itself is compact and walkable.', 'Improved promenade areas and better visitor facilities at viewpoints.', 'Coastal litter can be an issue; use bins and avoid plastics on the beach.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO destinations (id, destination_name, state_id, city_id, district, region, latitude, longitude, altitude_m, popularity_score, accessibility, nearest_airport, nearest_railway, nearest_major_city, nearest_major_city_distance_km, road_connectivity, trip_types, primary_attractions, activities_available, unique_experiences, hidden_gems, best_seasons, avoid_seasons, peak_season, off_season, average_temperature, rainfall_pattern, ideal_for, ideal_for_why, special_considerations, minimum_days, ideal_days, maximum_days, suggested_itinerary, accommodation_types, food_scene, safety_rating, safety_notes, internet_connectivity, mobile_network, atm_availability, language_spoken, permits_required, permits_details, local_culture, festivals_events, local_customs, shopping_highlights, local_cuisine_must_try, budget_range_json, mid_range_json, luxury_range_json, description, user_reviews_summary, recent_developments, sustainability_notes) VALUES ('dest-22', 'Rann of Kutch (White Desert, Dhordo)', 'IN-GJ', 'kachchh', 'Kachchh', 'West India', 23.7333, 69.8833, 15, 7.0, 'Moderate', '{"name": "Bhuj Airport", "distance_km": 80}'::jsonb, '{"name": "Bhuj", "distance_km": 80}'::jsonb, 'Bhuj', 80.0, 'Good roads from Bhuj to Dhordo and White Desert tent city during festival season.[web:213]', '{"Desert","Cultural","Photography","Festival","Adventure"}', '{"White Salt Desert (White Rann)","Rann Utsav Tent City (seasonal)","Kala Dungar (Black Hill)","Nearby craft villages"}', '{"Sunrise and sunset walks on the salt desert","Cultural shows and folk performances","Camel cart rides","Shopping for local handicrafts"}', 'Walking on a vast white salt desert that glows under moonlight and sunset during the Rann Utsav.[web:210][web:213]', 'Quieter edges of the White Desert away from main tent-city access points | Small artisan villages producing textiles and embroidery', 'Winter (Rann Utsav period)', 'Summer and monsoon when heat is extreme and Rann is waterlogged.[web:213]', 'Rann Utsav from late October/November to February/early March.[web:210]', 'March–September (especially monsoon when desert is often inaccessible)', '{"winter": "8-26\u00b0C", "summer": "28-42\u00b0C", "monsoon": "26-32\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'Very little rain overall but monsoon can flood low-lying salt flats making walks impossible.[web:213]', '{"Festival_goers","Photographers","Couples","Families_seeking_unique_experience"}', '{"Festival_goers": "Organised tents, shows, food courts and activities at Rann Utsav.[web:210]", "Photographers": "Surreal white landscapes, colourful local dress and craft.[web:213]"}'::jsonb, 'Open desert with strong sun and reflection off salt; carry sunglasses and layers for cold nights; permits sometimes required for border-adjacent stretches.', 2.0, 2.0, 3, 'Day 1: Arrive Dhordo tent city, evening sunset on White Desert and cultural programme; Day 2: Sunrise on Rann, visit Kala Dungar and nearby villages.[web:210][web:213]', 'Festival tent city (various categories) | Resort-style tents | Guesthouses and homestays in nearby villages', 'Buffet-style dining in tent city and local Gujarati thali options; vegetarian-heavy cuisine.[web:210]', 8.0, 'Organised festival zone is generally safe; avoid venturing too far into the desert alone at night.', 'Specific Wi‑Fi zones in tent city; mobile data variable but present near main hubs.[web:210]', 'Jio | Airtel | Vi (coverage varies by spot)', 'ATMs in Bhuj; limited near desert; carry cash.', 'Gujarati | Hindi | English (festival staff)', TRUE, 'White Desert near border can require permits; usually facilitated by tour or tent-city operator.[web:213]', 'Kutch region with strong craft, music and folk dance traditions.', 'Rann Utsav (major multi-month festival), local village fairs.[web:210][web:213]', 'Respect rural community norms; ask before photographing people.', 'Kutchi embroidery | Mirrorwork textiles | Leather handicrafts | Bandhani fabrics', 'Gujarati thali | Local snacks like fafda, jalebi | Millet-based village dishes', '{"accommodation_range": [1200, 2000], "food_range": [300, 600], "activities_range": [400, 800], "local_transport_range": [400, 800], "total_daily_range": [2300, 4200]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [2500, 5000], "food_range": [600, 1200], "activities_range": [800, 1400], "local_transport_range": [600, 1200], "total_daily_range": [4500, 8800]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [6000, 20000], "food_range": [1000, 2500], "activities_range": [1200, 2500], "local_transport_range": [800, 1500], "total_daily_range": [9000, 26500]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Rann of Kutch (White Desert, Dhordo) in Gujarat.', 'Memorable desert and cultural experience; most recommend winter Rann Utsav window for best conditions.', 'Expansion of tent city, improved roads and curated cultural experiences.', 'Desert ecosystem is fragile; stick to marked paths and follow organiser guidelines for waste disposal.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
