on and very rough sea conditions; check local advisories.[web:214]', 'December–February and weekends/holidays', 'Most of monsoon and very hot pre-monsoon months', '{"winter": "22-30\u00b0C", "summer": "26-36\u00b0C", "monsoon": "24-30\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'Receives northeast monsoon; cyclone-prone historically.[web:214]', '{"History_buffs","Offbeat_beach_seekers","Photographers","Road_trippers_from_Rameswaram"}', '{"History_buffs": "Ruins tell a story of a once-thriving town destroyed in 1964 cyclone.[web:214]", "Photographers": "Contrast of stark ruins and turquoise water.[web:211][web:214]"}'::jsonb, 'No major accommodation directly in ghost town area; best as day trip from Rameswaram; strong sun and wind; swimming often discouraged due to currents.', 1.0, 1.0, 2, 'Half- or full-day trip from Rameswaram: visit Pamban Bridge viewpoints, then Dhanushkodi ruins and beach, returning by sunset.[web:211][web:214]', 'Stay in Rameswaram (hotels, lodges) | No formal stays in core ghost town', 'Few stalls and basic vendors near parking/beach; main dining options back in Rameswaram.[web:214]', 7.0, 'Open coastal environment; watch tides, do not go too far into water; heed local restrictions on access areas.', 'Spotty mobile internet; do not rely on heavy data usage.', 'Jio | Airtel, with variable signal', 'ATMs in Rameswaram; none at the ghost town itself.', 'Tamil | Hindi (some) | Basic English with tour operators', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Coastal Tamil communities with strong religious ties to Rameswaram temple.', 'Pilgrimage circuits via Rameswaram; no major standalone festival at Dhanushkodi.', 'Respect ruins and avoid climbing fragile structures; dress modestly if combined with temple visits.', 'Shell items and small trinkets from local stalls | Better shopping options in Rameswaram town', 'Simple South Indian meals in Rameswaram | Fresh seafood (where available and appropriate)', '{"accommodation_range": [600, 1200], "food_range": [200, 400], "activities_range": [150, 300], "local_transport_range": [200, 500], "total_daily_range": [1150, 2400]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1200, 2500], "food_range": [400, 800], "activities_range": [300, 600], "local_transport_range": [400, 800], "total_daily_range": [2300, 4700]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [2500, 6000], "food_range": [600, 1500], "activities_range": [500, 1200], "local_transport_range": [500, 1000], "total_daily_range": [4100, 9700]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Dhanushkodi (Ghost Town & Beach) in Tamil Nadu.', 'Atmospheric and slightly eerie; visitors praise the raw beauty and the story of the ghost town.', 'Improved access roads and more organised day-tour options from Rameswaram.', 'Ruins and beach are fragile; avoid littering and disturbing structures.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
