'{"winter": "12-28\u00b0C", "summer": "26-42\u00b0C", "monsoon": "24-32\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'Significant southwest monsoon rainfall feeding the falls.', '{"Nature_lovers","Waterfall_chasers","Photographers"}', '{"Waterfall_chasers": "One of India''s widest waterfalls with impressive monsoon flow.", "Photographers": "Dramatic shots in both low and high water seasons."}'::jsonb, 'Safety barriers should be respected; do not attempt to get too close to edge; boat operations depend on water level.', 1.0, 1.0, 2, 'Half- or full-day trip based from Jagdalpur, combining multiple viewpoints and optional boat ride.', 'Simple resorts near falls | Hotels and lodges in Jagdalpur', 'Basic eateries near falls; more options in Jagdalpur.', 7.0, 'High drop and strong currents; maintain distance, especially in monsoon.', 'Limited near falls; better in Jagdalpur.', 'Jio, Airtel and BSNL in varying strength', 'ATMs in Jagdalpur; none at waterfall itself.', 'Hindi | Chhattisgarhi', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Bastar region with tribal communities and forest landscapes.', 'Regional fairs and festivals in Bastar; no major festival solely at the falls.', 'Respect local communities and avoid littering natural areas.', 'Tribal handicrafts from Bastar region | Local artefacts in Jagdalpur markets', 'Local tribal-inspired dishes (where available) | Chhattisgarhi thalis', '{"accommodation_range": [600, 1200], "food_range": [200, 400], "activities_range": [150, 300], "local_transport_range": [200, 400], "total_daily_range": [1150, 2300]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1200, 2500], "food_range": [400, 800], "activities_range": [300, 600], "local_transport_range": [300, 600], "total_daily_range": [2200, 4500]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [2500, 6000], "food_range": [600, 1500], "activities_range": [500, 1200], "local_transport_range": [400, 800], "total_daily_range": [4000, 9500]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Chitrakote Falls in Chhattisgarh.', 'Striking and relatively less crowded waterfall destination, appreciated by nature enthusiasts.', 'Improved viewpoints and basic tourist facilities around key viewing points.', 'Natural site; visitors should ensure they take back their waste and stay behind safety barriers.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
