ith fewer shacks open', '{"winter": "20-32\u00b0C", "summer": "26-35\u00b0C", "monsoon": "24-30\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'Heavy coastal rainfall June–September.', '{"Backpackers","Budget_beach_travellers","Pilgrims_who_enjoy_beaches","Yoga_retreat_participants"}', '{"Backpackers": "Affordable stays, chilled beach cafes and small community vibe.", "Pilgrims_who_enjoy_beaches": "Mahabaleshwar Temple plus easy access to multiple beaches."}'::jsonb, 'Sea conditions can be rough; caution while swimming; some trails between beaches involve steep sections.', 2.0, 3.0, 5, 'Day 1: Town and Gokarna Main Beach; Day 2: Kudle and Om Beach; Day 3: Trek or boat to Half Moon and Paradise beaches.', 'Guesthouses | Beach shacks (seasonal) | Simple hotels | Yoga/retreat stays', 'Mix of coastal Karnataka food and international backpacker menus at beach cafes.', 8.0, 'Small town generally safe; avoid deserted beach walks very late at night.', 'Decent 4G in town and main beaches; weaker in more remote coves.', 'Jio | Airtel | Vi', 'ATMs in Gokarna town; carry some cash to beaches.', 'Kannada | Konkani (some) | Hindi | English in tourism)', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Temple town with strong religious traditions coexisting with beach tourism.', 'Shivaratri and other temple festivals draw large pilgrim crowds.', 'Dress modestly in and around temple zones; different culture at beaches vs town.', 'Bead jewellery | Hippie-style clothes | Religious items', 'Local fish thali (for non-vegetarians) | South Indian tiffin | Simple coastal curries', '{"accommodation_range": [600, 1300], "food_range": [250, 500], "activities_range": [200, 400], "local_transport_range": [150, 300], "total_daily_range": [1200, 2500]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1300, 2500], "food_range": [400, 800], "activities_range": [300, 600], "local_transport_range": [250, 500], "total_daily_range": [2250, 4400]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [2500, 8000], "food_range": [600, 1500], "activities_range": [500, 1200], "local_transport_range": [300, 700], "total_daily_range": [3900, 11400]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Gokarna in Karnataka.', 'Considered more peaceful than Goa, with basic but charming beach stays and a temple-town core.', 'Gradual increase in mid-range resorts and organised yoga retreats.', 'Beach litter is an increasing issue; use refills, avoid single-use plastic and support clean-up friendly cafes.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
