re-monsoon weeks', '{"winter": "23-30\u00b0C", "summer": "26-34\u00b0C", "monsoon": "24-30\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'Heavy southwest monsoon; beach and cliff paths can be wet and windy.', '{"Backpackers","Couples","Wellness_travellers","Budget_beach_holidayseekers"}', '{"Wellness_travellers": "Concentration of yoga schools and Ayurveda centres.", "Backpackers": "Affordable stays and sociable cliff-strip atmosphere."}'::jsonb, 'Some cliff edges are unguarded; stay away from unstable sections; currents can be strong in water; heed lifeguard flags.', 2.0, 3.0, 5, 'Day 1: Cliff and beach; Day 2: Yoga/Ayurveda sessions and Sivagiri; Day 3: Explore nearby lakes/backwaters or Kollam side-trip.', 'Guesthouses | Cliff-top hotels | Homestays | Retreat centres', 'Strong cafe culture with Indian and international cuisine; many vegetarian and seafood options.', 8.0, 'Tourist-friendly; be cautious on cliff paths in rain and while swimming in rough sea.', 'Good around cliff and town area.', 'Jio | Airtel | Vi', 'ATMs in Varkala town and near main approach roads.', 'Malayalam | English (widely in tourism) | Hindi (some)', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Kerala coastal culture with ashram and temple influence near Sivagiri.', 'Sivagiri pilgrimage and standard Kerala festivals like Onam.', 'Beach wear accepted on cliff/beach; modest dress recommended when visiting temples/ashrams.', 'Beachwear | Ayurveda products | Handicrafts', 'Kerala fish curry (for non-vegetarians) | Appam and stew | Fresh coconut-based dishes', '{"accommodation_range": [700, 1300], "food_range": [250, 500], "activities_range": [200, 400], "local_transport_range": [150, 300], "total_daily_range": [1300, 2500]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1300, 3000], "food_range": [400, 800], "activities_range": [300, 600], "local_transport_range": [250, 500], "total_daily_range": [2250, 4900]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [3000, 9000], "food_range": [600, 1500], "activities_range": [500, 1200], "local_transport_range": [300, 700], 