'Monsoon months for adventure; shoulder weeks see fewer crowds', '{"winter": "8-22\u00b0C", "summer": "24-38\u00b0C", "monsoon": "22-30\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'North Indian monsoon pattern with heavy July–August rains.', '{"Backpackers","Spiritual_seekers","Adventure_travellers","Wellness_tourists"}', '{"Spiritual_seekers": "Many ashrams and satsangs along the river.", "Adventure_travellers": "Rafting, camping and short treks nearby."}'::jsonb, 'Some zones predominantly vegetarian and alcohol-free; rafting is seasonal and subject to river safety norms.', 2.0, 3.0, 5, 'Day 1: Jhula areas and Ganga Aarti; Day 2: Rafting and cafes; Day 3: Ashram or Beatles Ashram plus waterfalls/short hikes.', 'Ashrams | Budget guesthouses | Mid-range hotels | Luxury wellness resorts', 'Vegetarian-heavy with many cafes offering global health foods and traditional Indian meals.', 8.0, 'Busy yet generally safe; adventure activities should be with licensed operators.', 'Good 4G and Wi‑Fi in most tourist areas.', 'Jio | Airtel | Vi', 'Many ATMs around main market and ghats.', 'Hindi | Garhwali | English (widely in tourism)', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Spiritual pilgrimage town with mix of long-stay seekers and short-term tourists.', 'Yoga festivals, Ganga-related religious festivals, and seasonal fairs.', 'Conservative dress recommended at ghats/ashrams; remove footwear at temples and some ashram areas.', 'Spiritual books and items | Yoga clothing | Handicrafts', 'Local thali | Street-side chaat | Cafe-style healthy bowls', '{"accommodation_range": [600, 1200], "food_range": [200, 400], "activities_range": [400, 1000], "local_transport_range": [150, 300], "total_daily_range": [1350, 2900]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1200, 3000], "food_range": [400, 800], "activities_range": [800, 1500], "local_transport_range": [200, 400], "total_daily_range": [2600, 5700]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [3000, 12000], "food_range": [700, 1800], "activities_range": [1200, 2500], "local_transport_range": [300, 700], "total_daily_range": [5200, 17000]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Rishikesh in Uttarakhand.', 'Popular among both backpackers and families; many stay longer than planned due to relaxed vibe.', 'More boutique stays and upmarket wellness resorts along quieter riverbanks.', 'Ganga cleanliness is crucial; avoid plastic, use designated ghats and follow local eco-guidelines.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
