 "12-26\u00b0C", "monsoon": "12-20\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'Regular hill-station rain and mist in monsoon.', '{"Weekend_travellers_from_Delhi","Families","Birders_and_nature_lovers"}', '{"Weekend_travellers_from_Delhi": "Offbeat alternative to crowded Mussoorie with similar travel time.[web:232]", "Birders_and_nature_lovers": "Deoban forest ecosystems and quiet ridges."}'::jsonb, 'Limited big-town facilities; some areas inside cantonment have restricted access; fuel and ATMs mainly in gateway towns.', 2.0, 3.0, 4, 'Day 1: Reach and local walks; Day 2: Deoban and viewpoints; Day 3: Tiger Falls or nearby villages.[web:232]', 'Small hotels | Homestays | Camps', 'Local dhabas and in-house kitchens serving simple Indian food.', 8.0, 'Generally safe; drive carefully on forest roads and in fog.', 'Basic 4G in town; weaker in forest and remote hamlets.', 'Jio | Airtel, variable', 'Limited; withdraw in Dehradun or larger towns.', 'Hindi | Garhwali', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Garhwali villages with military presence in cantonment area.', 'Local fairs; nature remains the main draw.', 'Respect cantonment rules and village boundaries.', 'Very limited souvenir options; better shopping in Dehradun', 'Simple hill thali and fresh seasonal vegetables', '{"accommodation_range": [800, 1500], "food_range": [250, 500], "activities_range": [200, 400], "local_transport_range": [200, 400], "total_daily_range": [1450, 2800]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1500, 3000], "food_range": [400, 800], "activities_range": [400, 800], "local_transport_range": [300, 600], "total_daily_range": [2600, 5200]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [3000, 8000], "food_range": [700, 1500], "activities_range": [600, 1500], "local_transport_range": [400, 800], "total_daily_range": [4700, 15800]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Chakrata in Uttarakhand.', 'Well-liked as a quiet, old-world hill station without big malls or crowds.', 'More small-scale stay options and promotion as an offbeat weekend break.[web:232]', 'Forest and village environments are sensitive; avoid loud music and litter.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
