shut (typically July–September).[web:230]', 'December–April and long weekends', 'Very hot late May–June days and monsoon closure', '{"winter": "5-24\u00b0C", "summer": "24-42\u00b0C", "monsoon": "22-30\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'Central Indian monsoon with park closed during peak rains.[web:230]', '{"Wildlife_photographers","Families_with_interest_in_nature","First_time_tiger_safari_travellers"}', '{"Wildlife_photographers": "High tiger density plus diverse habitats and species.[web:230]", "First_time_tiger_safari_travellers": "Well-organised infrastructure and guides."}'::jsonb, 'Safari permits must be booked well in advance for core zones; strict park rules on noise and behaviour.', 2.0, 3.0, 5, '2–4 safaris over 2–3 days, mixing different zones; include one relaxed day for village visits or nature walks.[web:230]', 'Jungle lodges | Resorts (budget to luxury) | Homestays in buffer villages', 'Mostly in-lodge buffets or set menus with Indian and some continental dishes.', 9.0, 'Very safe if park rules are followed; wildlife viewing from vehicles only, no getting down in core.', 'Limited mobile data in forest belt; Wi‑Fi in some lodges.', 'Jio, Airtel (select pockets)', 'ATMs in nearby towns; carry cash to lodge.', 'Hindi | Local dialects | English (guides and lodge staff)', TRUE, 'Online/office safari permits per vehicle and zone; ID proof mandatory.[web:230]', 'Gond and Baiga tribal communities around buffer zones.', 'Local tribal and village fairs; park itself follows seasonal safari calendar.', 'Respect local communities and avoid intrusive photography.', 'Wildlife-themed souvenirs at some lodges | Local crafts in village shops', 'Simple MP thali at lodges or dhabas', '{"accommodation_range": [1500, 3000], "food_range": [400, 800], "activities_range": [1500, 2500], "local_transport_range": [500, 1000], "total_daily_range": [3900, 7300]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [3000, 6000], "food_range": [800, 1500], "activities_range": [2500, 4000], "local_transport_range": [800, 1500], "total_daily_range": [7100, 13000]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [6000, 20000], "food_range": [1200, 2500], "activities_range": [3500, 6000], "local_transport_range": [1200, 2000], "total_daily_range": [11900, 30500]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Kanha National Park in Madhya Pradesh.', 'Frequently ranked as a favourite tiger park for its landscapes and responsible tourism model.', 'Improved census numbers and focus on eco-tourism zoning.[web:230]', 'Stick to official safaris; avoid off-trail activities and insist on eco-friendly lodge practices.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
