mber–March and holiday periods', 'Pre-monsoon shoulder and monsoon closure', '{"winter": "7-26\u00b0C", "summer": "28-44\u00b0C", "monsoon": "24-32\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'Semi-arid with concentrated monsoon; park closed when tracks are wet.[web:230]', '{"First_time_safari_goers","Golden_Triangle_travellers","Wildlife_photographers"}', '{"First_time_safari_goers": "High chance of tiger sightings plus good tourist infrastructure.[web:230]", "Golden_Triangle_travellers": "Easy add-on to Delhi\u2013Agra\u2013Jaipur circuits.[web:233]"}'::jsonb, 'Safari allocations by zone; book early and avoid expecting specific tigers; follow guide instructions strictly.', 2.0, 3.0, 4, '2–4 safaris across different zones plus half-day for fort and town, typically within a 2–3 night stay.[web:230][web:233]', 'Budget lodges | Mid-range resorts | Luxury tented camps', 'Primarily resort restaurants with Rajasthani and North Indian menus.', 9.0, 'Park rules enforced; remain seated in vehicles and do not feed wildlife.', 'Decent 4G in Sawai Madhopur; resort Wi‑Fi near town.', 'Jio | Airtel | Vi', 'ATMs in Sawai Madhopur town.', 'Hindi | Rajasthani | English (tourism staff)', TRUE, 'Advance online booking recommended; options for shared and exclusive vehicles; zone allocation by department.[web:230]', 'Rajasthani rural communities around buffer; folk arts and crafts.', 'Local fairs and religious festivals; special safari demand around holidays.', 'Dress modestly in villages; tip guides and drivers responsibly rather than pushing for rule-breaking.', 'Wildlife art | Rajasthani textiles | Local handicrafts', 'Dal baati churma | Local kadhi and sabzis', '{"accommodation_range": [1500, 3000], "food_range": [400, 800], "activities_range": [1500, 2500], "local_transport_range": [400, 800], "total_daily_range": [3800, 7100]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [3000, 7000], "food_range": [800, 1500], "activities_range": [2500, 4000], "local_transport_range": [600, 1200], "total_daily_range": [6900, 13700]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [7000, 25000], "food_range": [1200, 2500], "activities_range": [3500, 6000], "local_transport_range": [1000, 1800], "total_daily_range": [12700, 35300]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Ranthambore National Park in Rajasthan.', 'Highly popular; many report memorable tiger sightings against ruined-palace backdrops.', 'Dynamic zoning and stricter vehicle caps to manage crowding.[web:230]', 'Choose operators and lodges prioritising conservation and low-noise safaris.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
