ays due to landslide and waterfall-risk alerts, especially in Ghat sections.[web:243]', 'October–January weekends and holidays', 'Some monsoon weeks and hot shoulder periods', '{"winter": "12-26\u00b0C", "summer": "20-32\u00b0C", "monsoon": "18-26\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'High rainfall due to Western Ghats monsoon; multiple waterfalls come alive.[web:240]', '{"Families","Couples","Nature_lovers","Road_trippers_from_Kerala/Karnataka"}', '{"Nature_lovers": "Abundant greenery, falls and viewpoints with flexible difficulty.", "Road_trippers_from_Kerala/Karnataka": "Scenic Ghat drives from multiple gateways.[web:243]"}'::jsonb, 'Check IMD and local alerts for landslides/floods in peak monsoon; some trails and caves may close during bad weather.[web:240][web:243]', 2.0, 3.0, 5, 'Day 1: Estate homestay and nearby viewpoint; Day 2: Edakkal Caves and falls; Day 3+: Banasura Sagar and forest/wildlife activities as permitted.', 'Homestays | Eco-resorts | Hotels in Kalpetta/Sulthan Bathery', 'Kerala meals, Malabar cuisine and resort buffets; many places offer both veg and non-veg options.', 8.0, 'Respect waterfall barriers and monsoon warnings; drive slowly on narrow Ghat roads.', 'Good 4G in main towns and many resorts; weaker in deeper valleys.', 'Jio | Airtel | Vi', 'ATMs in towns; limited in remote pockets.', 'Malayalam | English (tourism) | Kannada/Tamil (some) | Hindi (some)', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Mix of Kerala hill communities and tribal populations with agricultural base.', 'Local temple and church festivals; monsoon and Onam periods have special festivities.', 'Respect tribal village boundaries and ask before entering/photographing.', 'Spices and tea/coffee | Handicrafts and honey | Local chocolates', 'Kerala meals on banana leaf | Malabar biryani | Fish curries and appam–stew', '{"accommodation_range": [800, 1800], "food_range": [250, 500], "activities_range": [300, 700], "local_transport_range": [300, 700], "total_daily_range": [1650, 3700]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1800, 4000], "food_range": [400, 900], "activities_range": [700, 1400], "local_transport_range": [400, 900], "total_daily_range": [3300, 7200]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [4000, 15000], "food_range": [800, 2000], "activities_range": [1200, 2500], "local_transport_range": [600, 1200], "total_daily_range": [6600, 20700]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Wayanad in Kerala.', 'Seen as a calmer alternative to some busier hill stations with good mix of nature and culture.', 'Growth in eco-lodges and monsoon campaign marketing; increased emphasis on safety advisories.[web:240][web:243]', 'Hill slopes and forests are sensitive; follow stay guidelines on waste and avoid off-trail erosion.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
