d risk.[web:243]', 'Monsoon weekends and holidays', 'Dry summer weeks with less greenery', '{"winter": "12-28\u00b0C", "summer": "22-36\u00b0C", "monsoon": "20-26\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'Very high rainfall in monsoon; frequent low clouds and fog; flash-flood risk in heavy spells.[web:243]', '{"Road_trip_lovers","Monsoon_photographers","Friends_and_couples_from_Pune/Mumbai"}', '{"Road_trip_lovers": "Short, rewarding drive from Pune with forest, fog and waterfalls.[web:243]", "Monsoon_photographers": "Multiple roadside cascades and moody weather."}'::jsonb, 'Check IMD and district disaster alerts; avoid parking near edges, streams or under unstable slopes; drive slowly and avoid night driving in heavy rain.[web:243]', 1.0, 1.0, 2, 'Day trip from Pune: start early, drive via Mulshi to Tamhini and back, stopping only at safe, designated viewpoints; optional overnight at lake-view resort.', 'Lake-view resorts at Mulshi | Homestays and farmstays | Basic lodges', 'Roadside dhabas and resorts serving Maharashtrian and multi-cuisine meals.', 7.0, 'Weather-driven risks higher than crime; never enter flooded streams or waterfalls beyond designated safe zones.[web:243]', 'Mobile data workable at many points; weaker in deeper ghat sections.', 'Jio | Airtel | Vi (varies along route)', 'ATMs near Pune/Lonavala; few along inner route—carry cash.', 'Marathi | Hindi | English (some)', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Rural Maharashtrian villages and farming communities.', 'Ganesh Chaturthi and local temple fairs; monsoon itself is treated as a seasonal celebration.', 'Keep noise low in villages; avoid littering or drinking in public near residents.', 'Local jaggery and snacks from highway stalls', 'Maharashtrian veg and non-veg thalis | Bhakri with thecha and pitla', '{"accommodation_range": [800, 1800], "food_range": [250, 500], "activities_range": [200, 500], "local_transport_range": [300, 700], "total_daily_range": [1550, 3500]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1800, 4000], "food_range": [400, 900], "activities_range": [400, 800], "local_transport_range": [500, 900], "total_daily_range": [3100, 6600]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [4000, 12000], "food_range": [800, 2000], "activities_range": [600, 1500], "local_transport_range": [700, 1200], "total_daily_range": [6100, 16700]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Tamhini Ghat & Mulshi in Maharashtra.', 'Highly praised by monsoon-road-trip lovers; those prepared for rain find it unforgettable.', 'Increased awareness of safety advisories and IMD alerts being shared by travel communities.[web:243]', 'Do not block narrow village roads with parked cars; carry back all trash and avoid soap/shampoo in natural streams.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
