 intense; heavy-rain red-alert days for landslide risk.[web:243]', 'December–May weekends and summers for families', 'Some monsoon weeks with heavy rain', '{"winter": "10-24\u00b0C", "summer": "18-30\u00b0C", "monsoon": "16-24\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'Very high monsoon rainfall; frequent fog reduces visibility.[web:243]', '{"Families","Couples","Weekend_getaway_seekers_from_Mumbai/Pune"}', '{"Families": "Plenty of viewpoints, lake activities and accessible resorts.", "Weekend_getaway_seekers_from_Mumbai/Pune": "Well-known, easy-to-plan break with cool weather."}'::jsonb, 'Parking near main market and viewpoints can be challenging; book stays with parking or away from congestion.', 2.0, 3.0, 4, 'Day 1: Mahabaleshwar viewpoints and market; Day 2: Venna Lake and Panchgani/Table Land; Day 3: Strawberry farms (in season) and quieter walks.', 'Hotels | Resorts | Homestays | Heritage-style stays', 'Vegetarian and non-vegetarian restaurants, chaat and dessert outlets; strawberry and cream is a signature.', 8.0, 'Drive carefully on hairpin bends and in fog; supervise children near cliff edges.', 'Good in towns and many resorts.', 'Jio | Airtel | Vi', 'ATMs in Mahabaleshwar and Panchgani.', 'Marathi | Hindi | English (tourism)', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Maharashtrian hill communities with tourism-oriented economy.', 'Strawberry festival and local temple events; weekend rush often feels festive.', 'Standard hill-town etiquette; respect private farms and do not pluck without permission.', 'Strawberry products and jams | Chikki and fudge | Local handicrafts', 'Strawberries with cream | Maharashtrian thali | Corn-based monsoon snacks', '{"accommodation_range": [800, 1800], "food_range": [250, 500], "activities_range": [300, 700], "local_transport_range": [300, 700], "total_daily_range": [1650, 3700]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1800, 4500], "food_range": [400, 900], "activities_range": [700, 1400], "local_transport_range": [400, 900], "total_daily_range": [3300, 7700]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [4500, 15000], "food_range": [800, 2000], "activities_range": [1200, 2500], "local_transport_range": [600, 1200], "total_daily_range": [7100, 20700]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Mahabaleshwar & Panchgani in Maharashtra.', 'Long-time favourite for Mumbai–Pune region; some find it crowded in peak season but still scenic.', 'More mid-range resorts and homestays along approach roads; emphasis on monsoon road trip marketing.[web:243]', 'Waste and traffic are key concerns; walk when possible and avoid littering viewpoints.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
