where landslides or trail closures occur; peak summer afternoons for strenuous treks.[web:240]', 'October–January and long weekends', 'Some monsoon weeks; weekdays see fewer crowds', '{"winter": "12-24\u00b0C", "summer": "18-32\u00b0C", "monsoon": "16-24\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'Substantial monsoon rainfall adds mist and full waterfalls.[web:240]', '{"Trekkers","Coffee_and_nature_lovers","Friends_and_couples_from_Bengaluru"}', '{"Trekkers": "Access to Mullayanagiri, Karnataka\u2019s highest peak, and multiple trails.", "Coffee_and_nature_lovers": "Estate homestays blending coffee heritage with Western Ghats vistas."}'::jsonb, 'Check local regulations and guide requirements for treks and falls; respect private estate rules.', 2.0, 3.0, 5, 'Day 1: Estate stay and local walk; Day 2: Mullayanagiri/Baba Budangiri; Day 3: Falls or lakes plus relaxed coffee experiences.', 'Estate homestays | Resorts | Budget hotels in town', 'Homely Karnataka food in stays plus small restaurants in town; excellent filter coffee.', 8.0, 'Monsoon trails can be slippery; use local guides and proper footwear.', 'Good 4G in town, variable in remote estates.', 'Jio | Airtel | Vi', 'ATMs in Chikmagalur town; limited in outskirts.', 'Kannada | English (tourism) | Hindi (some)', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Coffee-growing communities with mix of plantations and villages.', 'Local temple festivals and hill fairs.', 'Ask before entering estate tracks; keep noise low in villages and forests.', 'Coffee and spices | Homemade chocolates | Local snacks', 'Karnataka vegetarian meals | Local chicken and mutton dishes in non-veg eateries | Fresh coffee at estate stays', '{"accommodation_range": [800, 1800], "food_range": [250, 500], "activities_range": [300, 700], "local_transport_range": [300, 700], "total_daily_range": [1650, 3700]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [1800, 4000], "food_range": [400, 900], "activities_range": [700, 1400], "local_transport_range": [400, 900], "total_daily_range": [3300, 7200]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [4000, 15000], "food_range": [800, 2000], "activities_range": [1200, 2500], "local_transport_range": [600, 1200], "total_daily_range": [6600, 20700]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Chikmagalur in Karnataka.', 'Favoured for its combination of treks and coffee homestays; less commercial than some big-name hill stations.', 'Growth in boutique homestays and curated trekking packages.[web:240]', 'Hill ecology is sensitive; follow Leave No Trace practices on trails and avoid river pollution.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
