r holiday weeks and long weekends; also busy during specific snow‑festival events.[web:275]', 'Most of year outside snow window; summer sees some trekking traffic but no skiing', '{"winter": "-4-8\u00b0C", "summer": "10-22\u00b0C", "monsoon": "12-18\u00b0C"}'::jsonb, 'Snow in winter, rain in shoulder/monsoon; road conditions can be impacted by weather.', '{"First_time_skiers","Families","Snow_view_lovers"}', '{"First_time_skiers": "Article comparisons emphasise Auli\u2019s smooth, groomed slopes and structured facilities for beginners.[web:275][web:278]", "Families": "Compact resort\u2011style setting with designated learning areas and local trainers.[web:278]"}'::jsonb, 'Long drive times; altitude acclimatisation helpful; book ski equipment and instruction in advance for peak weeks.[web:278]', 2.0, 3.0, 5, 'Rishikesh–Joshimath–Auli circuit with 2–4 snow days followed by down‑valley spiritual stops.[web:278]', 'Ski resorts | GMVN and private hotels | Guesthouses in Joshimath', 'Hotel‑based dining with North Indian and Garhwali dishes; limited independent cafes in peak snow belt.', 8.0, 'Structured slopes reduce risk, but beginners must follow instructor guidance and slope rules.[web:278]', 'Basic 4G/Wi‑Fi around resorts and Joshimath; may be slow during bad weather.', 'Jio | Airtel, BSNL (coverage varies with terrain).[web:278]', 'ATMs mainly in Joshimath; carry cash to Auli.', 'Hindi | Garhwali | Basic English with ski instructors and hotel staff.[web:278]', FALSE, 'Not required', 'Garhwali hill communities; winter months bring seasonal tourism focus.', 'Occasional skiing championships and winter events.[web:275]', 'Respect local temple norms in Joshimath and surrounding villages.', 'Woollens and small souvenirs in Joshimath', 'Garhwali dishes like aloo ke gutke | Simple hot pahadi meals in cold weather', '{"accommodation_range": [1200, 2500], "food_range": [300, 700], "activities_range": [800, 1500], "local_transport_range": [500, 1200], "total_daily_range": [2800, 5900]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [2500, 6000], "food_range": [600, 1200], "activities_range": [1200, 2200], "local_transport_range": [700, 1500], "total_daily_range": [5000, 10900]}'::jsonb, '{"accommodation_range": [6000, 16000], "food_range": [900, 1800], "activities_range": [2000, 3500], "local_transport_range": [900, 1800], "total_daily_range": [9800, 23100]}'::jsonb, 'Experience Auli (Garhwal Ski & Snow Resort) in Uttarakhand.', 'Well liked by families and first‑time skiers; often contrasted with Gulmarg as the gentler, more organised option.[web:275][web:278]', 'Featured heavily in 2025 ‘snow destinations’ and Auli‑vs‑Gulmarg comparisons.[web:275][web:278]', 'Keep slopes clean, avoid off‑trail damage to vegetation and minimise vehicle idling around snow zones.') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
